        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Vendors and SHA-256-verifies the CC BY-SA 4.0 cathedral termite mound photograph `datasets/termite_mound_convective_chimneys/macrotermes_cathedral_mound_specimen.jpg`, segments the earthen mound silhouette (`H = 347 px`, `W_base = 178.0 px`, `H/W_base = 1.9494` vs wild-type *Macrotermes* `H/W = 1.95`), extracts spire taper half-angle `9.46 deg`, and detects `8` prominent sunlit vertical flute ridges across the front hemisphere corresponding to `16` full-perimeter flutes (`segment_cathedral_mound_specimen`, L502-585)." ;
